      "statement": "Login branches execute in the order Altcha, folded identifier lookup (username via accountIdLower or email), lockout, deletion grace, failure-quota pre-occupation (TryIncLoginAttempts before the bcrypt compare — exhausted quota or locked account returns the same generic AUT0043 credential error without comparing), password, email verification, 2FA challenge (with twoFactorMethods), success; a missing account returns the same generic credential error as a wrong password, the new-device verification chain has been removed (new devices only get a post-login notification email), and the handler maps success and 2FA to 200 and verification to 403 (AUT0108 via NewExtraC with needVerification/email extra fields).",
